
  <sn><md>### Local to Cloud Synchronization

Local-to-cloud synchronization means transferring or synchronizing files from your **computer** to a **cloud storage service** such as MEGA, Google Drive, or OneDrive.

```text
┌─────────────────────┐
│   💻 LOCAL COMPUTER │
│                     │
│  📁 Documents       │
│  ├── 📄 Notes.pdf   │
│  ├── 📄 Photo.jpg   │
│  └── 📄 File.txt    │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
           │ rclone
           ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│    ☁️ CLOUD STORAGE │
│                     │
│  📁 Backup          │
│  ├── 📄 Notes.pdf   │
│  ├── 📄 Photo.jpg   │
│  └── 📄 File.txt    │
└─────────────────────┘
```
</md></sn>
